The '''Black Lagoon''' is a [[Location]] in the [[Rift Dimension]]. It can be entered through the [[Wyld Woods]] for {{Stat|rt|4:00}}.

{{RiftGuide|Slay Deadgehogs|Defeat the Leech Supreme|Eye: The Gillman|Enigma: Lagoon Cave|souls=5|Enigma: Mushroom Guy|Enigma: Spinning Runes|Montezuma's Third| Timecharm : Supreme Timecharm}}{{ConfirmationNeeded}}
== Features ==
=== Mushrooms ===
There are {{ID|Red Mushroom!Red|nl=y}} and {{Item|Brown Mushroom|link=}}s located around the '''Black Lagoon'''. When a player is within a few blocks of a mushroom, it will grow into a large mushroom, which the player can use to defend against the attacks of [[Deadgehog]]s.

=== Lagoon Current ===
If the player attempts to cross the lagoon to the {{Zone|Lagoon Hut}} by swimming, a current will push them away. The player must use [[Lil' Pad]]s to cross.

=== Lagoon Leeches ===
{{Main|Lagoon Leech}}
If the player goes into the lagoon, a [[Lagoon Leech]] will spawn. The player can stand on [[Lil' Pad]]s to prevent Lagoon Leeches spawning.

